{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20260921/photo/bkn-20260921180229770-0921_00822_001_01p.jpg?20260921181232\"/><p>張又俠開除黨籍軍籍。</p><p>中央軍委副主席張又俠、中央軍委聯合參謀部前參謀長劉振立，因嚴重違紀違法開除黨籍軍籍。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T10:18:30.596551+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":61,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none"}}